OL,3,AMigrants taken to Dover after more than
OL,4,A30 hours at sea
OL,5,
OL,6,FA total of 51 migrants have arrived in
OL,7,FDover on a small boat after spending
OL,8,Fmore than 30 hours at sea.
OL,10,FThe arrival at 00:30 BST came after
OL,11,Fhundreds of protesters gathered in the
OL,12,FHampshire town of Gosport on Tuesday
OL,13,Fevening as it was initially believed
OL,14,Fthis is where they would be brought
OL,15,Fashore.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
